notes:
17x17 -> 14x14, incumbent local 486,057 -> 291,844 (1.67x local, 1.45x judged). Almost all of it
is geometry: area2 289 -> 196 is 1.47x on its own. At side 14 one row is worth 2/14 = 14% of
ticks, so nothing here was bought with a row.

The lever: the input pipe no longer reaches the worker, it feeds the RELAY, which merges it into
the ring with R (ties break by reading order, so input's segment two rows above the worker's wins
every tick it has a value). The ring's initial contents (n, then v1..vn) then already ARE the pass
invariant "header plus n values", so MAIN and LOAD stop existing — four of the worker's ten rows.
Two smaller ones: EMIT parks a 1 that PASS moves to B, shrinking BODY's decrement from M1-N to -;
and the last pass (k==1) pushes no header, so the round boundary is a blocking r with no
round-over branch at all.

THIS GRID DEPENDS ON ROUND GATING and scoring.score_program does not model it — it concatenates
rounds into one stream, and fed that, the machine sorts all rounds interleaved (right multiset,
wrong order). Verified instead under lm.mjs judge --expected. The 25/25 verdict confirms the gate
is real on the live judge, as the statement ("You won't receive the next list until you finish
printing the current one") and GRADING.md:89 both said.

Sorting networks were priced and lose. Batcher on a single-man ring touches 126 pops + 126 pushes
against selection-against-a-carry's 120 total. Unrolled as rooms: a comparator needs two r, -, X,
+, W, two s plus perimeter = >=4x3 interior = 30 cells, x63 plus ~126 pipes = ~2,270 cells, side
>=48, area2 >=2,300 — 11.7x ours against at most ~10x on ticks. Odd-even transposition (8 rooms
reused 16x) lands ~282,000, a wash, for a full rebuild across 8 rooms of phantom-pipe surface.
The measurement that kills all of them: OBLIVIOUSNESS IS A COST HERE. n varies 1..16 and the
public rounds average 5.8; sum(n^2)/case is 136.6 against sum(n)/case 14.86, so a fixed 16-wire
network pays full price on a 3-element list where the O(n^2) loop pays 3 comparisons. The packed-
rank idea has the same defect — still 120 comparisons, plus pack/unpack per access.

